WEBVTT

00:13:28.136 --> 00:13:30.430
Like me, they are dreaming big.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:34.268
Earlier this year,

00:13:34.309 --> 00:13:36.520
I was on SOLA's campus in Kabul

00:13:36.562 --> 00:13:40.232
interviewing a girl
who was applying for sixth grade.

00:13:41.316 --> 00:13:44.278
I asked her why she
wanted to come to SOLA,

00:13:44.319 --> 00:13:47.489
which is a question
I ask all our applicants.

00:13:48.532 --> 00:13:50.075
She said,

00:13:50.868 --> 00:13:53.245
"I have dreamed of this.

00:13:54.288 --> 00:13:58.125
I've dreamed of coming to SOLA
ever since I was a little girl."